+<a name="onIdle"></a>
+### queue.onIdle() => Promise
+
+Returns a promise that resolves when the queue has no running or queued tasks.
+Each call creates an independent subscription. An already idle queue returns a
+resolved promise. A paused queue with pending tasks is not idle.
